# ═══ FILE KHOI DONG WINDOWS: GIU NGUYEN BYTE, KHONG DOI XUONG DONG ═══
#
# cmd.exe co mot loi kinh dien voi file .bat xuong dong kieu Unix (LF): khi
# mot khoi lenh vat qua ranh gioi bo dem doc, no nhay sai vi tri va CHAY
# NHUNG MAU CHU GIUA DONG. Khach 01/09/2026 gui anh dung canh do:
#
#     'M' is not recognized as an internal or external command
#     'ho' is not recognized as an internal or external command
#
# Truoc do Git normalize cac file nay ve LF trong kho (autocrlf), nen ZIP
# khach tai tu GitHub mang .bat dang LF - hong tren may khach, trong khi may
# nguoi lam tool thi chay ngon vi ban checkout da duoc doi lai CRLF. Vi tri
# vo con xe dich theo do dai file, nen sua file .bat la benh tu nhien xuat
# hien o cho khac.
#
# "-text" = Git coi la nhi phan: khong bao gio doi xuong dong, byte trong kho
# la byte tren may khach, ZIP tai ve la CRLF dung nhu da ghi.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.vbs -text
